<title>USA: Mednet MPC, auditor end relationship.</title>
<headline>Mednet MPC, auditor end relationship.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mednet, MPC Corp said its relationship with its auditing firm, McGladrey &amp; Pullen,&quot;has been terminated&quot; and that as a result, the company's 10-K filing will be delayed.</p>
<p>The company, which said it cannot predict when the auditing of its financial statements will be completed, did not provide further details.  Officials there were not immediately available to comment further.</p>
<p>The company said it has begun discussions with other accounting firms with the intent of finding a new auditor.</p>
</text>
